  "title": "正式开工！中国最北山姆会员店来了",
  "summary": "",
  "html": "<section style=\"margin: 0 0 0px; line-height: 0; font-size: 0; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://static.foodtalks.cn/admin/images/third_part/4ea851b32f135626032b9e78ca21d6f6.png\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 100% !important; height: auto !important; vertical-align: top; box-sizing: border-box;\" /></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.75; color: #888888; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">图片来源：黑龙江日报</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">期待已久的哈尔滨</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">山姆</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">，正式动工开建。</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 0 0px; line-height: 0; font-size: 0; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://fbif-gary-img-hz.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/wechat-layout/88c2bf52363a.png\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"黑龙江首家山姆 落子哈尔滨\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 100% !important; height: auto !important; vertical-align: top; box-sizing: border-box;\" /></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.75; color: #02396b; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">黑龙江首家山姆</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.75; color: #02396b; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">落子哈尔滨</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">10月15日，沃尔玛山姆会员店在</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">哈尔滨新区开工建设。</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">这也是黑龙江首店，也是山姆中国最北的门店项目。</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">该项目坐落于中源大道北侧、左岸大街西侧，规划用地面积4.17万平方米，总建筑面积6.54万平方米，规划建设地上两层会员卖场，同步配套停车位超千个。项目由黑龙江省建工集团按照绿色建筑三星标准建设，</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">预计2028年投入运营。</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 0; font-size: 0; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://static.foodtalks.cn/admin/images/third_part/29cd14a905dafa70e1670ca070061f5b.jpg\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 100% !important; height: auto !important; vertical-align: top; box-sizing: border-box;\" /></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 0 0px; line-height: 0; font-size: 0; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://static.foodtalks.cn/admin/images/third_part/984d8d55eacd6413d22627d50712d6d2.jpg\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 100% !important; height: auto !important; vertical-align: top; box-sizing: border-box;\" /></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.75; color: #888888; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">图片来源：黑龙江日报</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">据媒体报道，10月13日该地块已竖起带山姆LOGO的围挡。当时属地规划部门工作人员表示，该地块将用于建设大型商业项目，至于具体落位什么品牌暂无法答复。</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">天眼查APP显示，今年9月21日，哈尔滨好又多百货商业广场有限公司变更为哈尔滨沃尔玛山姆会员商店有限公司，地址变更为黑龙江省哈尔滨市松北区世茂大道66号12号楼（创新创业广场12号楼）110室，哈尔滨沃尔玛山姆会员商店有限公司实控人为沃尔玛中国有限公司。</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">随着哈尔滨店开工奠基仪式举行，至此山姆在东北地区落地门店已增至4家，其中大连香炉礁店、沈阳和平店已开业，沈阳皇姑店在建。</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">值得一提的是，就在两天前，据《长春日报》10月13日报道，长春市服务业大会上，南关区代区长、净月高新区管委会主任丁慧东透露，</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">山姆会员店确定落位长春，具体信息待官方公布。</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">若上述项目全部落地，山姆在东北将形成5店格局，东北核心城市四城齐备。</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 0 0px; line-height: 0; font-size: 0; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://fbif-gary-img-hz.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/wechat-layout/bdcd1325b87b.png\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"为什么是哈尔滨？\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 100% !important; height: auto !important; vertical-align: top; box-sizing: border-box;\" /></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.75; color: #02396b; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">为什么是哈尔滨？</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">黑龙江首店落子哈尔滨新区，既是企业对龙江消费市场潜力、区位优势和营商环境的认可，也是山姆深耕东北、打造高品质会员消费场景的战略选择。</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">沃尔玛（中国）公司事务总监移戈表示，</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">企业将扎根龙江市场，引入全球供应链，为区域商业繁荣与经济发展注入新活力。</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">项目投用后，将填补黑龙江省高端仓储零售业态空白，与融创茂、万象汇、枫叶奥莱、杉杉奥莱等商业综合体形成互补，进一步激发区域消费潜力，为哈尔滨打造区域性国际消费中心城市注入新动能。</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">其实落子哈尔滨早有铺垫。公开报道显示，2025年7月15日，黑龙江省委书记许勤在哈尔滨会见沃尔玛中国总裁及首席执行官朱晓静。许勤希望沃尔玛发挥资源和平台优势，深化与黑龙江在跨境电商、供应链等领域合作，谋划建设山姆会员店，培育消费新场景新业态新模式；朱晓静回应称，沃尔玛十分看好黑龙江市场，将顺应消费升级趋势，加快推动山姆项目落地。</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 0; font-size: 0; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://static.foodtalks.cn/admin/images/third_part/dd2f0540ba4bbba90149991745072e27.png\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 100% !important; height: auto !important; vertical-align: top; box-sizing: border-box;\" /></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 0 0px; line-height: 0; font-size: 0; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://static.foodtalks.cn/admin/images/third_part/2e488914cd46061350200cff8398285a.jpg\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 100% !important; height: auto !important; vertical-align: top; box-sizing: border-box;\" /></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.75; color: #888888; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">图片来源：黑龙江日报</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 0 0px; line-height: 0; font-size: 0; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://fbif-gary-img-hz.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/wechat-layout/2038a07ee0ac.png\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"山姆2026 一边狂开，一边圈地\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 100% !important; height: auto !important; vertical-align: top; box-sizing: border-box;\" /></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.75; color: #02396b; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">山姆2026</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.75; color: #02396b; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">一边狂开，一边圈地</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">在哈尔滨店开工前两天，山姆全国门店总数正式突破70家，主要分布在珠三角、长三角、环渤海、成渝等消费力较强的城市。</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">2026年，山姆已陆续新开无锡惠山、佛山顺德、济南、青岛、石家庄、北京房山、无锡江阴7家门店。山姆近期招聘信息显示，佛山禅城、台州、义乌、天津红桥、天津东丽、东莞厚街等新店已启动招聘，其中多家预计年内开业。</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">若按当前节奏，山姆2026年新增门店或超过10家，接近2025年创下的入华30年最高开店纪录。</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">新签约和敲定城市同样密集。据不完全统计，山姆已陆续敲定南京燕子矶、广东汕头、广州花都、广州黄埔、云南昆明、江西南昌、温州龙湾、厦门翔安、江苏南通、武汉洪山、山东烟台、深圳光明等</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">十余座城市的新门店。</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">其中烟台属意向合作文书，未纳入正式签约统计。此外，广东白云、陕西西安、河南郑州、沈阳皇姑、江苏吴江、北京通州等区域在建门店正加紧施工。截至2026年末，山姆全国门店总量有望超73家。</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #544545; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;\">从70家到73家，山姆的触角正从长三角、珠三角伸向东北腹地。若当前节奏延续，山姆离沃尔玛中国CEO朱晓静提出的“百店计划”又近了一步。</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 0px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #02396b; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; font-style: italic;\">来源：职业零售网</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #02396b; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; font-style: italic;\">作者：零售哥</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 0px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #02396b; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\">提示：</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 0px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #888888; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; font-style: italic;\">*本文为职业零售网原创，作者：零售哥，转载请联系出处。原文标题：《正式开工！中国最北山姆会员店来了》</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 8px 20px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: #888888; font-family: mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; font-style: italic;\">*FoodTalks资讯投稿与商务合作，请联系Bobo。</span></section>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 0; font-size: 0; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://fbif-gary-img-hz.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/wechat-layout/07079a66940e.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 100% !important; height: auto !important; vertical-align: top; box-sizing: border-box;\" /></section>\n<p style=\"margin:0 8px;padding:0;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"color:#02396b;font-size:18px;font-family:mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.75;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;\">关注公众号</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 8px;padding:0;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#888888;font-size:12px;font-family:mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.75;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;\">点击卡片关注FoodTalks公众号</span></p>\n<section style=\"height:20px;line-height:0;font-size:0;\">&nbsp;</section>\n<p style=\"margin:0 8px;padding:0;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"color:#02396b;font-size:18px;font-family:mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.75;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;\">加入微信群</span></p>\n<section style=\"margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 0; font-size: 0; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://fbif-gary-img-hz.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/wechat-layout/d5ec80f5ba41.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 100% !important; height: auto !important; vertical-align: top; box-sizing: border-box;\" /></section>\n<p style=\"margin:0 8px;padding:0;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"color:#888888;font-size:15px;font-family:mp-quote, 'PingFang SC', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.75;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;\">*如遇二维码失效无法加群，请联系工作人员Lemon（微信号：FBIF_Lemon）。</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;line-height:0;font-size:0;min-height:0;height:0;\"><br/></p>",
